# Phrase this turn

OWASP LLM06:2025, mitigation that a human approves the action. The phrase is `allow-<class>: <target> — <what>`.

Classes: `db-update`, `db-delete`, `git-push`, `github-write`, `deploy`, `infra`.

Postgres is a database. INSERT and UPDATE are `allow-db-update`. DELETE, TRUNCATE, DROP, and ALTER are `allow-db-delete`. The target is the database name. There is no `postgres` class.

The phrase is in the person's message this turn. A phrase from an earlier turn does not count. A wildcard does not count. Do not type the phrase for them.

A hint is not the phrase. "Push it", "when you can", "we should migrate", a plan, or an analysis does not authorize the write.

A SELECT, a local file edit, `git add`, and `git commit` are not gated.

This plugin writes no file.
